<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">Nahum</book>
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ninevi khaw puakgik. Elkos mi Nahum kilakna bu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa mullithat Pathian leh phulak ching ahi; Toupa’n phu a la a, hehna in a dim hi; Toupa’n amah doumite tung ah phu a la a, a melmate ading in hehna a kholkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa a lungnel a, nakpi a thilhihthei ahi, mimawhte siam a tangsak mahmah kei ding; Toupa’n pingpei leh huihpi ah a lampi a nei a, meipite a khe leivui ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuipi a sal a, a kangtat sak a, lui tengteng leng a kangsak khin a; Bashan gam a bah a, Karmel tang leh Lebanon tang paklunte a vuai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tang liante amah ziak in a ling ua, tang neute a zul mang ua; a ma ah lei a vuak a, ahi khovel leh asung a om tengteng toh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lunghih louhna mai ah kua ahia ding thei ding a, a hehna thupitak ah kua ahia om thei ding? A hehna mei bang a sunbuak ahi a, suangpite a kekzak sak vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa zaw a hoih a, mangbat ni a kulh kip ahi; amah a ginnna uh koihmite a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh tuikhang luanglet zang in huai mun manthat vekna a tungsak ding a a melmate khomial a delhlut ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa kalh in bang na gel ua? bei sipsipna a tungsak ahi, haksa nihveina a tung kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lingnok bang a om in a uain dawn un diah kawt dimdem bang in om mahleh, buhpawl keu bang mai a hihman vek in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang a pawt mi khat Toupa kalh a thil gilou ngaihtuahmi, gitlouhna thuhilhmi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: a hat theihtawp un hat mahle uh, tam leng tampi himah le uh, huchi pi in leng vatpuk in a om ding ua, a mangthang ding uhi. Hon na hihgim khin mah leng k’on hihgim nawnta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tunzaw na kiang a kipan a hakkol ka kitansak ding a, nang gakna khaute ka kitatsak vek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n na tungtang thu ah thu a pia hi, na min chi bang a tuh ahi nawnta kei ding a: na pathiante inn a kipan milim bawltawm leh milim sunte ka hih mangthang ding a; na han ka bawl ding; na gilou ngal a chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tangte a tanchinhoih tun a, lemna thu tangkoupihte khe en dih; Aw Judah, na Ankuang lui inla, na thuchiamte tangtun in; mi thuginalou in a hon pal paisuak nawn kei ding a; hih manthat vek ahita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kitam gawpsakpa doutu na mai ah a hongpawt hi: kigalvan inla, na lampi veng in, na kawng khauhsak inla na thilhihtheihna hattak in bawlhoih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hihsemite’n Israel thupina hihsia in a grepguite hihtan mahle uh, Toupa Jakobte thupina a ma a bang in tungding nawn ngal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mi hatte lum sansak ahi a, mi hangsante a sanau in a kivan ua; a kisakna ni’n kangtalaite kahpasik tet in a te kelkel ua, teipite mulkim huaitak in a phe zolzol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kangtalaite kongzing ah a tai gomgom a; lamlian zate ah a kiphu noknok ua; meisel bang in a lang ua, khophia bang in a tai zualzual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A miliante a sam khia a: a kituak pailai a kisui ua; kulhbang lam zuan in a kinoh ua, kihumbitna ding a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui kongkhakte hon ahi a, kumpipa in hihsiat in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan Huzzab salmat in a paimang pih ua, a sikhanute’n a awm uh tum in vakhu bang a ham in a kah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nidanglai a kipan Ninevi khua zaw dil bang ahi; himahleh a mi tampi a taikhia ding ua, khawlin, khawlin, chi in kikou mahle uh kuamah a kihei kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dangka sik gallak in laksak unla, dangkaeng leng gallak in laksak un; gou manpha a dim ahihman in thil kisekkhawm leh vanhoihte tawi bei ni a nei kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sukvuak in a om a, a vuak keuhkeuh a, a siang sipsip: lungtang a zulmang a, khukte a kihot ua, kawng tengteng a na tuntun a, avek ua mel a mualkhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Humpinelkai khosakna mun, Humpinelkai pite leh a noute nekding a balnenna leh a lausak ding omlou a Humpinelkai leh humpinelkai tekte pai vialvialna mun koimun hita ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Humpinelkai tal in a noute khamkhop a botnen a, Humpinelkai pite adin a keilum a, a kawkhukte uh sakeih in a dimsak a, a omna kawkhuk samatte a dimsak in, a bu kim loupa a bohzan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n , ngai dih, k’on dou ahi, a kangtalaite ka halkhu vungvung ding a, na humpinelkai noute namsau in a hihmang ding; lei a na sa keih ka sutawp ding a, na palaite aw zak ahi nawnta kei ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sisan suahhat khopi tung a gik hi; zuau leh kilohna in a dimkhin a; a sa keih uh tatlak lou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zepna ging, kangtalai khe ging, sakol tawmte, kangtalai tai gopgopte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakol tungtuangmi sakol a tuangte, namsau te zolzolte, teipi te zualzual toh; mi thah om lemlumte, luang om ziazua toh; luang in bei chih mahmah a neikei; siluangte pal in a kisuipuk uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai kizuak melhoih, bumsiamnu, a angkawmna ziak a nam zuak a, a bumhatna ziak a inkuan zuaknu angkawmna thupi mahmah ziak a hon gawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai in, ka hondou ahi; na mai lam ah na puan ka lem ding a; na vuaktanna namte kiang ah leh na zahlakna kumpipa gamte kiang ah ka ensak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nin kihhuai mahmah in ka hontheh ding a, zumhuai mahmah in k’on bawl ding a, muhnop ading in k’on koih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, nang honmu peuhmah nang a kipan a taimang ding ua, Ninevi khua a hong segawpta hi: kuan amah sun ding a, a hehnemtu ding koi a zong ding ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Luite kikal a om Noamon, a kim a tui in a um, a kulh ding a tuipi zang a kulhbang ding a tuipi nei sang in na hoihzaw ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia leh Aigupta a hatna ahi a, huai bel tawp hun neilou ahi; Put leh Lubim bel nang hon panpihte ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchipi in leng lakmang in a om a, sal in a tang a: kongzing teng tawp ah a naupang neute a paihnen sak uh: a mi thahte uh ading in ai a san ua, a mi liante tengteng khainiang a gak ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang leng na khamsam ding a, sel in na om ding; melma ziak in kulh kip na zonglai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kulh tengteng theipi kung, gah min masa pulh bang ahi ding ua: a lin peuhmah uleh nemi kam ah a kelutzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai in, na sung a na mipite numei ahi ua; na melmate din na kongpi a kihong heuhou a: na kikalhna siktawnte mei in a kangtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Um kimvel a na omsung ading in tui tawi inla, ka kulhte hihkip in: tungman omna ah hoh in, belhkipna chil in, lei haltakna thuk hihkip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai ah mei in a hong kangtum ding a, namsau in a hon satlum ding a, singnget bang in a honhih mangthang ding hi. Singnget bang in kipungsak inla, khaukhup bang in kihihpung in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sumsinmite van aksi sang a tam in na khangsak a: singnget in a hihsia a, a leng mang mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpilukhu khu na mite lah khaukhup bang ahi ua, na sepaihte khovot ni a huandai a khaupe hon bokkhawm bang ahi uh, himahleh ni a hongsuak a, a leng mang ua, a omna mun uh theih ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Assuria kumpipa aw, na belamchingmite a lusu uhi: na miliante a khawl ua: na mipite tangte ah a dalh ua, pikhawmmi kuamah a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na natna damna sing a omkei; na liamna a thupi mahmah hi: na husa za peuh in khut a hon betkhum ua; na gitlouhna thuak khalou kua a om a?
  </para>
</usx>
